  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Plots the dither pixel (plot_dither_pixel) at 4 points: (X, Y), (159 - X, Y), (159 - X, 199 - Y) and (X, 199 - Y). Input: X = x (0-159), Y = y (0-199). Keeps cursor_x and cursor_y."},
    {"at":57,"placement":"line","text":"Plots one pixel at X = x (0-159), Y = y (0-199) in the colour of the dither pattern: dither_colours[(y and 1) * 2 + (x and 1)]. $1525 gives the 2-bit value of that colour in the cell, plot_pixel_bits writes it. current_colour does not change."},
    {"at":77,"placement":"side","text":"Colour of this point of the dither pattern."},
    {"at":82,"placement":"side","text":"A = 2-bit value of current_colour in this cell."}
  ],
